    {
      "id": "Q_S1nFp2jQZRNypzfhADb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -372.00020345052053,
      "y": 757.5668563842771,
      "width": 546.5796508789062,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b04",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1422508174,
      "version": 1583,
      "versionNonce": 749338473,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788464527913,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "RATE LIMITER ALGORITHMS\n\nFixed Window Counter\n  Counter resets every fixed interval\n  + Simple, low memory\n  - Boundary effect: 2x burst at window edges\n\nSliding Window Log\n  Stores timestamp of every request\n  + No boundary effect\n  - High memory (stores every request)\n\nSliding Window Counter\n  Weighted avg of current + previous window\n  + Fixes memory issue\n  - Small approximation error\n\nToken Bucket\n  Bucket refills at steady rate, request consumes token\n  + Smooths bursts, industry standard\n  - Tuning bucket size is the key design knob",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "RATE LIMITER ALGORITHMS\n\nFixed Window Counter\n  Counter resets every fixed interval\n  + Simple, low memory\n  - Boundary effect: 2x burst at window edges\n\nSliding Window Log\n  Stores timestamp of every request\n  + No boundary effect\n  - High memory (stores every request)\n\nSliding Window Counter\n  Weighted avg of current + previous window\n  + Fixes memory issue\n  - Small approximation error\n\nToken Bucket\n  Bucket refills at steady rate, request consumes token\n  + Smooths bursts, industry standard\n  - Tuning bucket size is the key design knob",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
